Description:
    Create the migration for a trigger publishing a table's row changes to NATS.
    The payload is {table, op, at, row}; the publish cannot roll the write back.

Examples:
    rails generate active_record_pgnats:publish_trigger maps_devices

        create: db/migrate/[TIMESTAMP]_create_nats_publish_trigger_maps_devices.rb

    rails generate active_record_pgnats:publish_trigger maps_devices --subject="devices.%s.%s"
